// agent is, whom it acts for, what it may do, and who pays. Its order: the
// four questions, what you need for what you sell, a signature against an
// OAuth token, OAuth and MCP, card networks, the person behind the agent,
// anonymous credentials, the other schemes, how FORA answers the four
// questions, the questions, and About FORA with the sources.
//
